  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f6dfa4177484054489fae24c01f066f5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HowToPlay
  contentText: {fileID: 1574438454}
  languageButtonText: {fileID: 268323706}
  languageButton: {fileID: 1734985984}
  spanish: "COMO JUGAR\n\nA / D o flechas: moverte\nEspacio: saltar (doble salto
    en el aire)\nClick izquierdo: lanzar una orbe de luz\n\nJunt\xE1 todas las llaves,
    derrot\xE1 esqueletos y escap\xE1 por la reja.\nCuidado: ten\xE9s solo 3 corazones."
  english: 'HOW TO PLAY


    A / D or arrows: move

    Space: jump (double jump
    in the air)

    Left Click: throw a light orb


    Collect all the keys, defeat
    the skeletons and escape through the gate.

    Careful: you only have 3 hearts.'
